Vendored URL/URLSearchParams polyfill bundle for QuickJS.

Built from cached npm packages:
- whatwg-url v7.1.0 (MIT), https://www.npmjs.com/package/whatwg-url
- buffer v6.0.3 (MIT), https://www.npmjs.com/package/buffer
- base64-js v1.5.1 (MIT), https://www.npmjs.com/package/base64-js
- ieee754 v1.2.1 (BSD-3-Clause), https://www.npmjs.com/package/ieee754
- tr46 v1.0.1 (MIT), https://www.npmjs.com/package/tr46
- webidl-conversions v4.0.2 (BSD-2-Clause), https://www.npmjs.com/package/webidl-conversions
- lodash.sortby v4.7.0 (MIT), https://www.npmjs.com/package/lodash.sortby
- punycode v2.3.1 (MIT), https://www.npmjs.com/package/punycode

The bundle is generated with esbuild from:

  globalThis.Buffer = require("buffer").Buffer;
  const whatwgURL = require("whatwg-url");
  globalThis.URL = whatwgURL.URL;
  globalThis.URLSearchParams = whatwgURL.URLSearchParams;

License texts are in the corresponding npm packages. This file records the
vendored provenance for redistribution review.
